  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Noticed a regression from live regarding stations. Users in stations seem to lag behind the station, like they're returning their network position rather than being locally offset from the station.\n\nRepro steps: \n\n1. use an avatar with a seat such as this avatar:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_f845b270-64e2-445b-8f9f-434aa050d05d\n\n2. Have another user get in a seat\n\n3. Move the avatar\n\n4. Observe the other user lagging behind\n\nExpectation/Behavior on Live:\n\nUser stays effectively parented/offset from the station even under  motion\n\nNotes:\n\nmainly tested this between myself and one other person who was on Live. I'll see about testing beta->beta and getting a video later.",
